Tell me about it.

116
00:05:44,701 --> 00:05:47,739
It's so damn loud.

117
00:05:47,762 --> 00:05:50,696
This is seriously bad.

118
00:05:50,719 --> 00:05:53,474
Working again tomorrow?

119
00:05:53,498 --> 00:05:57,057
Yeah, tomorrow too.

120
