How many times did you pull?

157
00:07:47,355 --> 00:07:50,655
I pulled 10 times.

158
00:07:50,678 --> 00:07:53,145
Seriously?

159
00:07:53,168 --> 00:07:56,801
I’ll pull one more time.

160
