Did you check your bag?

265
00:13:01,439 --> 00:13:05,311
I did, but it’s not there.

266
00:13:05,335 --> 00:13:08,168
Seriously, it’s gone?

267
00:13:08,191 --> 00:13:11,258
Yeah, this is the worst.

268
00:13:11,281 --> 00:13:14,058
When did you last use it?

269
